---
import "../styles/landing.css";
---

<div class="af-landing">
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="af-hero">
    <div class="af-hero__inner">
      <div>
        <span class="af-hero__eyebrow">
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span>Docs</span>
          <span style="opacity: .5;">·</span>
          <strong>Developer guide</strong>
        </span>
        <h1 class="af-hero__title">Integrate Allfeat<span class="dot">.</span></h1>
        <p class="af-hero__lede">
          Anchor creative works on the Allfeat blockchain straight from your product. Drop in the
          white-label widget for a turn-key registration UX, or drive the same flow from your backend
          with the REST API.
        </p>
        <div class="af-hero__cta">
          <a class="af-btn af-btn-primary" href="/ats/widget/guides/quick-start/">
            Quick start
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a class="af-btn af-btn-secondary" href="/ats/">ATS overview</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="af-hero__side" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="af-hero__side-head">
          <span class="traffic"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span>
          <span>~ embed.html</span>
        </div>
<pre><span class="af-tk-com">&lt;!-- White-label web component --&gt;</span>
<span class="af-tk-punc">&lt;</span><span class="af-tk-kw">script</span> <span class="af-tk-prop">src</span>=<span class="af-tk-str">"https://cdn.allfeat.org/widgets/ats/v3/ats-widget.iife.js"</span><span class="af-tk-punc">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class="af-tk-kw">script</span><span class="af-tk-punc">&gt;</span>

<span class="af-tk-punc">&lt;</span><span class="af-tk-kw">ats-widget</span>
  <span class="af-tk-prop">site-key</span>=<span class="af-tk-str">"cpk_your_public_key"</span>
  <span class="af-tk-prop">network</span>=<span class="af-tk-str">"testnet"</span>
  <span class="af-tk-prop">mode</span>=<span class="af-tk-str">"register"</span>
<span class="af-tk-punc">&gt;&lt;/</span><span class="af-tk-kw">ats-widget</span><span class="af-tk-punc">&gt;</span></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services -->
  <section class="af-section">
    <div class="af-section__head">
      <div class="af-section__eyebrow">Services</div>
      <h2 class="af-section__title">Start with ATS.</h2>
      <p class="af-section__sub">
        Allfeat Time Stamp is the first service of the platform. Pick the integration surface that fits
        your stack — both back the same on-chain registration flow under your organization's account.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="af-service-card">
      <div class="af-service-card__head">
        <div class="af-service-card__meta">
          <span class="af-service-card__tag">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>
            Service
          </span>
          <span class="af-service-card__sep">/</span>
          <span class="af-service-card__name">ATS · Allfeat Time Stamp</span>
          <span class="af-service-card__status">Available</span>
        </div>
        <p class="af-service-card__desc">
          Register and update creative works on the Allfeat blockchain on behalf of your end-users.
          Track each transaction in real time and reconcile completions back to your own user records.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="af-path-grid">
        <a class="af-path af-path--widget" href="/ats/widget/">
          <span class="af-path__badge">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/></svg>
            Widget · White-label
          </span>
          <h3>Plug-and-play web component</h3>
          <p>
            A drop-in <code>&lt;ats-widget&gt;</code> element. One <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> tag
            and your users get the full registration flow — themed to your brand, no forms or upload
            UI to write.
          </p>
          <div class="af-path__links">
            <span class="af-path__lk">Embed in any page <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
            <span class="af-path__lk">JWT session tokens <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
            <span class="af-path__lk">Theme via CSS variables <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
            <span class="af-path__lk">Widget reference <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a class="af-path af-path--api" href="/ats/api/">
          <span class="af-path__badge">
            <svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
            REST API · Custom
          </span>
          <h3>Build your own flow</h3>
          <p>
            Single bearer token, four HTTP calls — <code>init</code> → upload → <code>prepare</code>
            → <code>confirm</code>. Drive registrations from your backend pipeline, mobile, or any
            non-browser client, with signed webhook callbacks.
          </p>
          <div class="af-path__links">
            <span class="af-path__lk">Authenticate with API keys <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
            <span class="af-path__lk">Register a work <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
            <span class="af-path__lk">Webhook signatures <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
            <span class="af-path__lk">API reference <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section class="af-section af-section--pad-top-tight">
    <div class="af-section__head">
      <div class="af-section__eyebrow">Foundations</div>
      <h2 class="af-section__title">What every integration gets.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="af-feat-grid">
      <div class="af-feat">
        <div class="af-feat__icon">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Per-organization keys</h4>
        <p>Scoped credentials per organization — public <code>cpk_</code> + secret <code>csk_</code> for the widget, single bearer <code>afo_sk_live_</code> for the API. Domain allowlist enforced on every session.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="af-feat">
        <div class="af-feat__icon">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Signed webhooks</h4>
        <p>HMAC-SHA256 signed deliveries on lifecycle events — <code>work_registered</code>, <code>work_updated</code>, <code>work_failed</code> — with a per-key webhook URL and rotating secret.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="af-feat">
        <div class="af-feat__icon">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Idempotent writes</h4>
        <p>Reservation-based job IDs and an <code>Idempotency-Key</code> header make the init/prepare/confirm flow safe to retry — no double-spend, no duplicate on-chain registration.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="af-feat">
        <div class="af-feat__icon">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3h7v7H3zM14 3h7v7h-7zM14 14h7v7h-7zM3 14h7v7H3z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Testnet & mainnet parity</h4>
        <p>Two parallel chains share the same API surface. Validate every integration on the freemium <code>testnet</code>, then swap a single field to ship on <code>mainnet</code>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="af-feat">
        <div class="af-feat__icon">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Per-action scopes</h4>
        <p>Restrict tokens to a single capability — register-only, update-only — and optionally bind them to a specific work via <code>allowed_ats_id</code>. Least privilege by default.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="af-feat">
        <div class="af-feat__icon">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h4>Transparent pricing</h4>
        <p>Every <code>prepare</code> returns the full quote — network fee, deposit, service fee, storage fee — debited from your AFT credit balance only on <code>confirm</code>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA strip -->
  <div class="af-cta-strip">
    <div>
      <h3>Ready to integrate?</h3>
      <p>Start with a testnet registration and validate the flow end-to-end in minutes — free freemium quota, no credits required.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="af-cta-strip__buttons">
      <a class="af-btn af-btn-primary" href="/ats/widget/guides/quick-start/">Start building</a>
      <a class="af-btn af-btn-secondary" href="https://app.allfeat.org">Open dashboard</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
